    "Actual TSX string/template class consumers scanned across all dashboard/src, rather than matching the substring access-. Six exact consumers have one ./Access.css import each. SwaggerDocsPage has only swagger-* class names and remains unchanged without the unnecessary import.",
    "Access.css is not imported at App root. Each shared actual access widget brings its styles when used outside AccessPage. Vite lazy-route CSS loading remains a final build/browser prerequisite, not inferred acceptance from AST equivalence.",
    "Resource inspector module is lazy and reached only from open disclosure with a valid paired canonical run/project/report owner. Owner key remains synchronous source identity reset. Suspense fallback and rejected-module LazyLoadBoundary are inside the optional disclosure, preserving the containing archive report and close control.",
